# top-level file comment
use skill briceyan/pdf-processing # inline use comment

service github: ```md # inline declaration header comment
---
transport: http
url: https://mcp.github.com/mcp
headers:
  Authorization: Bearer $GITHUB_TOKEN
---

Use this service when the agent needs GitHub access.
```

struct ReviewResult:
  summary: string # inline struct field comment

prompt review: ```md # inline prompt header comment
---
params: path, focus?
---

Review {{path}} carefully.
{{focus}}
```

thunk review(_, path?: path) -> ReviewResult: # inline thunk header comment
  models = gpt-5 # inline directive comment

  Review the target carefully. # inline thunk body comment
